		(property "Description" "Dallas/Maxim DS18B20 1-Wire Temperature Sensor\n\nThe DS18B20 reports degrees C with 9 to 12-bit precision, -55C to 125C (+/-0.5C). Each sensor has a unique 64-Bit Serial number etched into it - allows for a huge number of sensors to be used on one data bus.\n\nhttp://datasheets.maximintegrated.com/en/ds/DS18B20.pdf Datasheet\n\nSparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/245 One Wire Digital Temperature Sensor - DS18B20 (SEN-00245)"
